## 🌐 1. Konfigurasi Sambungan Jauh Automatik (.github/workflows/remote-deploy.yml)
Sila cipta fail konfigurasi baharu ini di dalam folder .github/workflows/remote-deploy.yml untuk membolehkan GitHub Actions menolak dan mengesahkan kod secara automatik ke platform pengeluaran awan pilihan anda apabila kod digabungkan (merged) ke cawangan main atau develop-spark4:

name: Multi-Cloud Production Deployment
on:
  push:
    branches: [ "main", "develop-spark4" ]
jobs:
  # TRACER 1: Automasi & Pengesahan Domain Vercel (Laman Frontend Jekyll / Next.js)
  deploy-vercel:
    name: Deploy & Validate Vercel Domain Gateway
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - name: Checkout Source Code
        uses: actions/checkout@v4

      - name: Install Vercel CLI
        run: npm install -g vercel@latest

      - name: Pull Vercel Environment Information
        run: vercel pull --yes --environment=production --token=${{ secrets.VERCEL_TOKEN }}

      - name: Build Site Artifacts
        run: vercel build --prod --token=${{ secrets.VERCEL_TOKEN }}

      - name: Deploy Project & Enforce Domain Integrity (sazwan.com)
        id: vercel-action
        run: |
          DEPLOY_URL=$(vercel deploy --prebuilt --prod --token=${{ secrets.VERCEL_TOKEN }})
          echo "PRODUCTION_URL=$DEPLOY_URL" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT
                # Menyelesaikan isu domain misconfiguration secara automatik
      - name: Verify Vercel DNS & Routing Readiness
        run: |
          echo "🔍 Menyemak ketersambungan pintu gerbang domain..."
          curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}" https://sazwan.com | grep -E "200|301|302" || exit 1
  # TRACER 2: Automasi Docker Orchestration ke Hostinger VPS (Django API & Clojure Engine)
  deploy-hostinger-vps:
    name: Container Push to Hostinger VPS
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - name: Checkout Source Code
        uses: actions/checkout@v4

      # Menggunakan aksi rasmi Hostinger VPS untuk penempatan docker-compose.yml
      - name: Deploy Stack on Hostinger VPS via API
        uses: hostinger/deploy-on-vps@v2
        with:
          api-key: ${{ secrets.HOSTINGER_API_KEY }}
          virtual-machine: ${{ vars.HOSTINGER_VM_ID }}
          project-name: "sgae-ultimate-ecosystem"
          docker-compose-path: "./docker-compose.yml"
          environment-variables: |
            DB_ENGINE=django.db.backends.postgresql
            DB_NAME=django_test_db
            DB_USER=postgres
            DB_PASSWORD=${{ secrets.DB_PASSWORD }}
            DB_HOST=postgres_db

